{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國人氣女團Blackpink成員Jisoo，今天（16日）聯同何猷君太太奚夢瑤及國際超模Stella Maxwell，到尖沙咀出席一個開幕慶祝活動，身為代言人的Jisoo再次來港，吸引逾千粉絲到場，前排粉絲更早於昨晚到場霸靚位。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T13:20:21.916602+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T12:49:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T00:34:57.805368+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T13:17:46.115778+00:00","content_hash":"0cf75c4ffc8ef883cf7a697f815af1c0bb6195ed9fe8f4a4f6749a248ede097d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}